{"id": "86171", "name": "פישוט שבר מורכב – ((b+1)/a + 1)/b (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Simplify the following:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\frac{b+1}{a}+1}{b}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Leave your answer as a single fraction in its simplest terms.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">= [[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">One operation at a time</b><br>When required to perform combinations of multiplication or division the best trick is to focus on one operation at a time. In this example: first divide each term of the numerator by <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b\\)</span>, then bring the two fractions to the common denominator <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(ab\\)</span> and add them:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\frac{b+1}{a}+1}{b} = \\frac{b+1}{ab}+\\frac{1}{b} = \\frac{b+1}{ab}+\\frac{a}{ab} = \\frac{a+b+1}{ab}. \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.